 cheek with one finger. The woman said, \"粉耳朵粉鼻子，圆眼睛亮得像黑葡萄，摸起来软到心化，\"\n\n**【分镜 3 / Shot 3】** *(预计时长 / Length: 6s)*\n**中文：** 中景镜头。女人直视镜头，双手将毛绒小兔子端在胸前，生动地说话。女人说：“像抱了团会呼吸的云朵！睡觉抱它超治愈，放沙发当靠垫也超萌。”\n**English:** Medium shot. The woman looks directly at the camera, holding the plush bunny in front of her chest with both hands, speaking vividly. The woman said, \"像抱了团会呼吸的云朵！睡觉抱它超治愈，放沙发当靠垫也超萌。\"\n\n**【分镜 4 / Shot 4】** *(预计时长 / Length: 5s)*\n**中文：** 中景镜头。女人直视镜头，面带灿烂的微笑，将毛绒小兔子抱在怀里。女人说：“喜欢的宝子扣1，今天直播间给你们炸个萌到跺脚的福利价！”\n**English:** Medium shot. The woman looks directly at the camera with a bright smile, hugging the plush bunny in her arms. The woman said, \"喜欢的宝子扣1，今天直播间给你们炸个萌到跺脚的福利价！\""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [799.2104662292531, 1067.8526325448263], "scale": 0.49500000000000066}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "LTX2.3-Prompt Relay-全局提示词-分镜提示词-自动生成-多图版-V2", "bounding": [73.83964538574219, 91.0728530883789, 2451.320556640625, 109.48835754394531]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "不要动它", "bounding": [-808.5420532226562, 1877.271240234375, 621.1566162109375, 397.6000671386719]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1386.7266845703125, 246.8446807861328, 1521.237060546875, 657.8112182617188]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "👉用我的邀请码注册送1000RH币👉邀请码：rh-v1542", "bounding": [78.2999267578125, -53.62743377685547, 1891.9930419921875, 83.41885375976562]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "抖音、B站、YT等平台同名账号：青橙Lab", "bounding": [86.19722747802734,